{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1412912-which-mage-faction-do-you-fit-in-with-and-why","id":1412912,"title":"Which Mage faction do you fit in with? And why?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-10T14:48:06-07:00","id":1412912,"title":"Which Mage faction do you fit in with? And why?","content":"Traditions? Technocracy? Disparate Alliance? (Hopefully not the Marauders or Nephandi)<br /> <br /> I\u2019m very intuitive and I like the idea of magick, so defo not the Technocracy. I\u2019d pick the Traditions, but only because I\u2019m basically not sure exactly what the Disparate Alliance\u2019s philosophy is. Also, I like the Hollow Ones\u2019 emphasis on Romanticism, but not so much their goth style (with a few exceptions, my characters are usually more prep).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-10T15:01:53-07:00","id":1412914,"title":"","content":"Probably the Sons of Ether, out of any.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-10T15:44:04-07:00","id":1412923,"title":"","content":"Cool. I like the Verbenae, Cult of Ecstasy (Sahajiya) or Hollow Ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-10T17:43:29-07:00","id":1412934,"title":"","content":"For me, Order of Hermes. I'm a nerd, into history and see things in a big picture way. Science and magic aren't all that different--so Techgnosi Order of Hermes. I could play many of the Houses--though Ex Miscellena offers the most options because you can do your own little tweak within the larger Hermetic paradigm.<br /> <br /> The Disparate Alliance is a group of what used to be called the Crafts, plus Orphans (unaffiliated) mages who join. Each group has its own ideas--they are working together because the other factions are wrong. A Templar and a Taftani may see the world in very different ways or they might overlap.<br /> <br /> The Hollow Ones are discussed in several books, including a Tradition book for Revised Era.<br /> <br /> For a take on the Hollow Ones from a White Wolf freelancer who helped work on the Disparate Alliance in M20, James Sambrano, here's a link to the Mage the Podcast episode<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://magethepodcast.com/index.php/2020/08/29/paradigm-deep-dive-gothic-and-hollower-magick-with-james-sambrano/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://magethepodcast.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cropped-test.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://magethepodcast.com/index.php/2020/08/29/paradigm-deep-dive-gothic-and-hollower-magick-with-james-sambrano/\" target=\"_blank\"> Page not found &ndash; Mage: The Podcast </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://magethepodcast.com/index.php/2020/08/29/paradigm-deep-dive-gothic-and-hollower-magick-with-james-sambrano/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://magethepodcast.com/index.php/2020/08/29/paradigm-deep-dive-gothic-and-hollower-magick-with-james-sambrano/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T03:14:36-07:00","id":1412977,"title":"","content":"a orphean. Because I don\u2019t look having responsibilities","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T03:19:50-07:00","id":1412980,"title":"","content":"From what I know from me, the most fitting one is marauders. Because I lived through some really ugly mobbing including my own mother back in school that made me either wish to kill myself or everyone else but luckily I did neither.<br /> Mayby Celestial Chorus too because I am sure Jahwe spoke to me back then when I decided to jump and after it, it whas like the world whas different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","